Let $ABCD$ be a convex quadrilateral, and let $G_A,$ $G_B,$ $G_C,$ $G_D$ denote the centroids of triangles $BCD,$ $ACD,$ $ABD,$ and $ABC,$ respectively.  Find $\frac{[G_A G_B G_C G_D]}{[ABCD]}.$

[asy]
unitsize(0.6 cm);

pair A, B, C, D;
pair[] G;

A = (0,0);
B = (7,1);
C = (5,-5);
D = (1,-3);
G[1] = (B + C + D)/3;
G[2] = (A + C + D)/3;
G[3] = (A + B + D)/3;
G[4] = (A + B + C)/3;

